      {
        "author_name": "Usama Shaheer",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103574398037478133520/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVVgN_CRNuVZHrH0haRB-jXbCxhe8pxJNDiqnULfe6NicAkGUo0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I was looking cell phone reparation shop in the areas saint Lazare or vaudreuil  after research ,I found the place at Sonic gas station in saint lazare has a repair service drop off. I recently got repaired my iPhone 15 pro Max water damage they took only two days and did very great job now its working very fine like new so I highly recommend them. They have  reasonable prices as well.\nThank you ezfix🙏🏼",
        "time": 1762468731,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "HONEY SINGH",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104262175781924984749/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWzkvQdfphIq6-pNjq6cD9OiQMmsVK9Mjkc44rBWIXosf6Z2jqadg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Ez fix mobile is a very convenient place for repair cell\nphone. Recently I got repaired from them for my iPhone 14 Pro Max for the water damage and they repair very fast in one business days and I am very surprised I checked with some other location. They said its take one week and ezfix fix my phone 📱 one day so I’m very happy. I highly recommend ez fix mobile.",
        "time": 1761682208,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Phone Plus 2",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107532039610448799928/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI_9gv5CAWQCizyj7iLUpkmeKFy29Za0HPNHGHWlzBb22BPZw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Ezfix mobile is a good place for drop off in Sanint lazare at sonic gas stationI always  get repair my phone with ezfix. They have very reasonable prices and good customer support. I highly recommend",
        "time": 1763499101,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Haroon Adrees",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108246432890923548146/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6pArFroGgpEPFg-ipIMUDv1oZkGwbYvcDeKfnO-L9fEbwSA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "This weekend got my iPhone repaired with EZFIX.\nThanks to my friend Yasir Satti for sharing the new location with me.\n\nVery convenient  to drop at Saint Lazare location at the sonic gas station. Service was  excellent also super quick. My device was delivered to me within 24 hours.\nGot some repairs done in the past but now don't need to drive far anymore.\nI highly recommend them for all kind of smart device repairs.\nGood guys and like always on time. 😀",
        "time": 1759715986,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "S M",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109025813185566081260/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6FiOCxtqkgE81_wJKbieeaCK9iwzRWbGztMoa5xWZqiWsbw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Update:\nBE AWARE! They use cheap parts that do not last!!! The screen we had replaced now has a black spot on it that appeared out of nowhere, no accident, no impact, and does not respond to touch in that area.\n\nAmazing service! We dropped my son’s broken iPhone 14 off at Sonic at 2:30pm and were told that it would be ready the next day, to our surprise we got a phone call at 7pm that it was ready to be picked up! The phone looks perfect and even came home with a complimentary phone case and screen protector. Highly recommended! Thank you!",
        "time": 1767565230,
        "translated": false
      }
